type: software
title: "HDM: a hybrid decision model"
abstract: >-
  Official implementation of "The Value of Thinking: Learning When to Reason in
  Hybrid Decision Models". One backbone with two decision modes and a learned
  self-routing block that prices thinking before either mode runs.
